<title>FINLAND: Huhtamaki 8-mth profit rises 42 pct.</title>
<headline>Huhtamaki 8-mth profit rises 42 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to end-August, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items		   286 vs 201</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)	   6.78 vs 4.90</p>
<p> Net sales				  5,148 vs 5,237</p>
<p> Operating profit			   379 vs 309</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of analysts' forecasts was for a 270 million markka (range 222 million to 314 million).  </p>
<p> Depreciation				  335 vs 304</p>
<p> Net financial items		 charge 83 vs 94 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items		charge 190 vs nil</p>
<p> Associated cos			  loss 10 vs 14 loss</p>
<p> Taxes					    55 vs 57</p>
<p> Net profit				     41 vs 144</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish confectionery and packaging group is Huhtamaki Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 024x</p>
</text>
